resources.string:
"JavaScript to run after the page has fully loaded. Useful for DOM updates, styling, or injecting behavior.

Your code content will be wrapped as follows to prevent polluting the global scope and avoid conflicts with other scripts:
    (function() {
        // <YOUR CODE>
    })()"

"JavaScript to run immediately when the page starts loading. You can use this for early DOM manipulation or overriding functions.

Your code content will be wrapped as follows to prevent polluting the global scope and avoid conflicts with other scripts:
    (function() {
        // <YOUR CODE>
    })()"
